5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so important that we all feel connected. I wonder if we can see how our seating affects our conversations?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should be objective. I want to know about the distribution of the desks and how they were handled previously.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I'm worried about the cost. Maybe we should check the billing and the quotes for the wiring?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! But I also want to know how much time we actually spend setting up every day. Let's look into the pilot floor!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,You're all so sentimental. I care about the actual environment. I'll be looking into the noise levels and the ergonomics.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, that sounds very fair. I think looking at the joiners' experiences might also tell us about our connections.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, that is a reasonable suggestion. I will also look into the staff survey to see the complaints.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
