60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B would keep us together by function, which helps the new joiners, but Option C ensures everyone gets a turn by the window.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B creates a permanent class of ""window-less"" employees. Option C is the only way to distribute the disadvantage fairly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option C... if we move the whole block, does that mean we re-run the power? If so, the cost would be huge.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is definitely out! The morning routine is too long. Between B and C, C sounds more exciting, but B is easier.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is a nightmare. You'd have to spend days re-adjusting your chair and monitor every time you rotate. It's irrational.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, I understand your concern for fairness, but @Shunichi is right about the physical toll of moving.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Fairness is not a luxury; it is a requirement for a healthy team. We cannot ignore the staff survey's complaints about daylight.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Option B is the safest for the budget. No repeated facility charges, no wasted area.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"But @Toshio is right about the windows! Maybe we can just... rotate the chairs? No, that's not an option.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Just pick B. It's the only one that doesn't waste time, money, or our spinal health.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we choose B, we must promise to make an effort to talk across the aisles, as the project strands did.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I cannot support a plan that knowingly leaves some people in the dark. I will vote for rotation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go with B. It's the most stable for the budget and the least stressful for me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm torn! But the ""half-packed boxes"" thing really scared me. I'll vote for B to keep things simple.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Finally, some common sense. B is the only logical choice for anyone who actually works at their desk.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will support the majority for the sake of peace, and I believe B can work if we are mindful.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I maintain that this is a failure to address the inequality of the workspace.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you for understanding... I feel much better about this.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mio,,Yay! Let's just make sure we have a great coffee area so we still hang out!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"As long as I don't have to move my monitor arm again this year, I'm happy.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
